00:01:02.413 --> 00:01:03.980
&gt;&gt; TO OUR FRIENDS IN NEW YORK,

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.248
IF YOU DON'T TAKE CARE OF YOUR

00:01:05.249 --> 00:01:06.449
