00:01:13.357 --> 00:01:17.493
RETRO- GRESSIVE MAYOR IN

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:18.394
NEW YORK CITY WHO IS DESTROYING

00:01:18.395 --> 00:01:20.029
THE QUALITY OF LIFE.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:21.030
HE'S A DISGRACE.

00:01:21.031 --> 00:01:22.832
&gt;&gt; Laura: SOME IN THE

00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:23.599
COMMUNITY WERE STILL WILLING TO

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.635
