PEOPLE HAD WATER BALLOONS AND

00:01:33.377 --> 00:01:36.212
THEY WERE DOUSING EACH OTHER.

00:01:36.213 --> 00:01:36.979
IT'S NOT UNCOMMON.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.181
&gt;&gt; Laura: UNBELIEVABLE.

00:01:38.182 --> 00:01:39.816
JUST LIKE THERE WERE SOME FOLKS

00:01:39.817 --> 00:01:40.717
WHO DIDN'T BAT AN EYE HEARING

00:01:40.718 --> 00:01:44.921
THINGS LIKE THIS.

00:01:44.922 --> 00:01:49.892
&gt;&gt; [CHANTING]

00:01:49.893 --> 00:01:55.131
&gt;&gt; PIGS IN A BLANKET.

00:01:55.132 --> 00:01:59.202
&gt;&gt; [CHANTING]

00:01:59.203 --> 00:02:01.871
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT WAS DURING THE

00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:02.305
OBAMA YEARS.

00:02:02.306 --> 00:02:03.740
THE DISRESPECT OF THE POLICE HAS

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:06.409
BEEN BUILDING SINCE THE HEIGHT

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:07.043
OF THE ANTI-VIETNAM WAR

00:02:07.044 --> 00:02:07.410
MOVEMENT.

00:02:07.411 --> 00:02:11.814
