00:02:13.617 --> 00:02:17.053
USING THE TERM PIG TO DESCRIBE

00:02:17.054 --> 00:02:18.855
POLICE OFFICERS.

00:02:18.856 --> 00:02:22.191
&gt;&gt; THE YOUTH INTERNATIONAL PART

00:02:22.192 --> 00:02:23.126
PARTY, THEY CONVERGED ON

00:02:23.127 --> 00:02:23.459
CHICAGO.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.495
THEY SAID THEY WERE THERE TO

00:02:25.496 --> 00:02:27.864
PROTEST THE WAR, POVERTY,

00:02:27.865 --> 00:02:30.433
RACISM, AND OTHER SOCIAL ILLS.

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:31.234
SOME OF THEM WERE ALSO

00:02:31.235 --> 00:02:33.336
DETERMINED TO PROVOKE A

00:02:33.337 --> 00:02:34.404
CONFRONTATION.

00:02:34.405 --> 00:02:35.638
&gt;&gt; Laura: WELCOME OF COURSE

00:02:35.639 --> 00:02:37.373
THE DISRESPECT OF OUR MILITARY

00:02:37.374 --> 00:02:40.510
VETS FOLLOWED WHEN THEY RETURN

00:02:40.511 --> 00:02:40.943
FROM OVERSEAS.

00:02:40.944 --> 00:02:42.645
&gt;&gt; WE DID WHAT WE WERE ASKED TO

00:02:42.646 --> 00:02:42.912
DO.

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:44.614
A LOT OF PEOPLE DIDN'T LIKE IT.

00:02:44.615 --> 00:02:45.648
THERE WAS A LOT OF FLAK ABOUT

00:02:45.649 --> 00:02:46.249
IT.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.217
WHEN WE CAME BACK, WE WERE SPIT

00:02:48.218 --> 00:02:49.819
ON AND CALLED BABY KILLERS.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.788
WE DID WHAT WE FELT WE NEEDED TO

00:02:51.789 --> 00:02:53.156
DO FOR OUR COUNTRY.

00:02:53.157 --> 00:02:55.124
&gt;&gt; Laura: GOD BLESS HIM.

00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:55.792
PRESIDENT REAGAN BROUGHT US

00:02:55.793 --> 00:02:57.460
MORNING IN AMERICA AND HE HELPED

00:02:57.461 --> 00:02:59.695
INSPIRE A NEW GENERATION OF

00:02:59.696 --> 00:03:01.664
YOUNG PATRIOTS WHO WERE EAGER TO

00:03:01.665 --> 00:03:03.399
TURN THE PAGE ON THAT

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.834
UNFORTUNATE CHAPTER.

00:03:04.835 --> 00:03:08.004
OF COURSE THAT DIDN'T STOP THE

00:03:08.005 --> 00:03:09.639
LEFT.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.040
THEY HAD ALREADY BURROWED INTO

00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:12.842
