00:03:38.235 --> 00:03:40.269
MUCH RIDICULED EVERYTHING ABOUT

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.138
TRADITIONAL AMERICAN VALUES AND

00:03:42.139 --> 00:03:44.574
REPLACE THEM WITH SOMETHING MORE

00:03:44.575 --> 00:03:47.076
PROGRESSIVE OR TOO MANY OF US,

00:03:47.077 --> 00:03:48.845
OR REGRESSIVE.

